<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάστρις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span> or
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pot-bellied</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					14.26
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάστρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).154
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				69
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as Subst., <i>glutton</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1604
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				816
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.176c
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστρίστερος</span>
			<i>more of a glutton</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				195
			</span></i>: as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάστρις ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.261
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>affected with tapeworm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cake</i>, made in Crete, Chrysipp. Tyan. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.647f
			</span></i>.</div>
